1
00:00:00,115 --> 00:00:03,145
(Girl dressed as a Witch:)- It's a great party.
- Thank you.

2
00:00:04,420 --> 00:00:06,450
(Witch:)The monster foods, they're really fun.

3
00:00:06,655 --> 00:00:10,315
(Stuart:)Oh, yes, thank you.
I like to think of fun things like that...

4
00:00:10,526 --> 00:00:15,516
(Stuart:)...because I'm fun,
I'm not clinically depressed at all.

5
00:00:16,331 --> 00:00:18,991
(Amy:)Sheldon, get in here.

6
00:00:28,410 --> 00:00:30,400
I should have picked hickey.

7
00:00:31,013 --> 00:00:32,533
(Stuart:)Hey, look at you guys!

8
00:00:32,781 --> 00:00:36,151
I'm Raggedy Anne and he's Raggedy C-3P0.

9
00:00:37,286 --> 00:00:39,846
(Sheldon:)It was a compromise. I lost.

10
00:00:41,957 --> 00:00:45,187
(Raj:)Can you believe Stuart's walking around
taking credit for this party?

11
00:00:45,727 --> 00:00:48,057
(Raj:)- Who cares?
- What do you mean, who cares?

12
00:00:48,297 --> 00:00:50,787
Look what I pulled off here.
The DJ's on fire...

13
00:00:50,999 --> 00:00:53,159
(Raj:)...there's a TARDIS photo booth
in the back...

14
00:00:53,368 --> 00:00:58,138
(Raj:)...oh, my God, the food.
Stuart wanted Kraft Draculoni and Cheese.

